OL,3,GNEWSA'I was left broken' - Woman taking
OL,4,Acivil case against 'church that failed 
OL,5,Aher'                                   
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details 
OL,8,Fthat some readers may find distressing.
OL,10,FA woman who is taking a civil case     
OL,11,Fagainst her former church, over an     
OL,12,Fallegation that she was groomed and    
OL,13,Fsexually abused by a youth leader when 
OL,14,Fshe was a teen, has said she was failed
OL,15,Fby those who should have protected her.
OL,17,FJessica, not her real name, had been a 
OL,18,Fmember of a youth group in a Church of 
OL,19,FIreland parish in County Antrim when   
OL,20,Fshe said she was first sexually        
OL,21,Fassaulted at the age of 17 by a much   
OL,22,Folder, married man.                    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
